{"id":"4839","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4839_main_irisation-iridescence_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在德国巴伐利亚阿尔卑斯山上方的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状云（透镜状）</span>中可以看到虹色效果或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">彩虹色</span>。</p>\n<p>彩虹色是由构成云的非常小的、均匀尺寸的液滴或冰晶的光波衍射引起的。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">绿色和粉红色</span>最常出现，颜色通常是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">柔和的色调</span>。虹彩可出现在与<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳</span>相同的大体方向的云上。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Claudia Hinz","location":"德国巴伐利亚阿尔卑斯山文德尔施泰因山峰","latitude":"纬度: 47° 42' 10'' N","longitude":"经度: 12° 0' 44'' E","date":"03 January 2012 1449 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.3"}]}]}